Ayo pergi, Kak Yang.

05:23.040 --> 05:23.570
Kak Dong.

05:26.000 --> 05:26.530
Kak Dong.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.120
Ponsel.

05:32.310 --> 05:32.909
Untuk apa?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.070
Aturan.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.090
Kak Yang,

05:35.830 --> 05:37.510
