08:44.870 --> 08:45.520
Halo.

08:54.240 --> 08:54.750
Baik.

08:58.240 --> 08:58.880
Kak Yang.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.040
Ayo pergi.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.480
Kak Dong di mana?

09:15.320 --> 09:15.920
Ayo pergi.

